WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.776 --> 00:00:16.742
An armored truck drove along West Street.

2
00:00:17.682 --> 00:00:19.083
Two guards sat in the front.

3
00:00:19.103 --> 00:00:22.204
"I'm glad there's no traffic," said the driver.

4
00:00:22.224 --> 00:00:25.285
"Yep," said the other guard.

5
00:00:26.185 --> 00:00:29.927
Suddenly—shwoosh! Something grabbed the truck.

6
00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:32.268
"Whoa!" cried the driver.

7
00:00:36.888 --> 00:00:38.589
The truck crashed into a mailbox.

8
00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:44.673
A voice called out, "Yee-ha!"

9
00:00:47.735 --> 00:00:50.077
Brumm! Brumm!

10
00:00:50.117 --> 00:00:54.240
"Those monster trucks are awesome!"

11
00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:54.960
cried Mara.

12
00:00:56.041 --> 00:00:58.223
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Arena.

13
00:00:59.123 --> 00:01:00.524
They were watching monster trucks.

14
00:01:01.665 --> 00:01:03.086
The trucks were really loud.

15
00:01:04.047 --> 00:01:05.608
They all looked like different things.

16
00:01:06.764 --> 00:01:08.065
One truck looked like a gorilla.

17
00:01:09.026 --> 00:01:10.908
Another one had a shark's fin on top.

18
00:01:11.909 --> 00:01:14.050
Brumm! Brumm!

19
00:01:14.951 --> 00:01:17.113
A red and blue monster truck drove into the arena.

20
00:01:17.874 --> 00:01:21.717
The crowd cheered.

21
00:01:21.737 --> 00:01:24.199
"It's the Rocket Girl monster truck!"

22
00:01:24.519 --> 00:01:25.180
Jack cried.

23
00:01:26.341 --> 00:01:27.222
Roxy smiled.

24
00:01:28.523 --> 00:01:30.785
The truck had a cape and two bunches of hair.

25
00:01:32.046 --> 00:01:34.148
Two arms stuck out over its front wheels.

26
00:01:35.852 --> 00:01:36.792
"Cool!" said Terrell.

27
00:01:36.812 --> 00:01:39.714
"It looks like Rocket Girl flying!"

28
00:01:40.794 --> 00:01:43.075
Brumm! Brumm!

29
00:01:44.055 --> 00:01:46.456
The Rocket Girl monster truck tore through the mud.

30
00:01:48.077 --> 00:01:48.937
Everyone cheered.

31
00:01:48.957 --> 00:01:53.339
"I can't wait to see the truck crush those cars!"

32
00:01:53.719 --> 00:01:54.319
said Jack.

33
00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.881
He pointed to a row of junky cars in the arena.

34
00:01:58.901 --> 00:02:01.442
The truck went up a dirt ramp and flew through the air.

35
00:02:04.263 --> 00:02:05.264
Everyone cheered again.

36
00:02:07.476 --> 00:02:11.697
Crunch! The Rocket Girl monster truck landed on the junky cars.

37
00:02:12.677 --> 00:02:13.498
Metal twisted.

38
00:02:14.118 --> 00:02:15.018
Glass shattered.

39
00:02:16.338 --> 00:02:17.639
The crowd cheered loudly.

40
00:02:18.699 --> 00:02:21.400
"Go, Rocket Girl monster truck!"

41
00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:27.802
"Woo-hoo!" "The Rocket Girl monster truck is the best!"

42
00:02:28.802 --> 00:02:32.123
Brumm, brumm, brumm, brumm!

43
00:02:33.283 --> 00:02:36.144
The Rocket Girl monster truck spun around in circles.

44
00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.401
Mud went everywhere!

45
00:02:39.501 --> 00:02:40.902
Roxy and her friends cheered.

46
00:02:40.922 --> 00:02:45.344
"I wonder if Rocket Girl is driving that truck," said Jack.

47
00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:48.166
"I doubt it," said Terrell.

48
00:02:48.986 --> 00:02:50.207
Roxy was surprised.

49
00:02:50.227 --> 00:02:52.688
"Really?" Terrell shrugged.

50
00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:57.411
"Yeah. I'm sure Rocket Girl has more important things to do."

51
00:02:58.431 --> 00:02:59.352
Roxy smiled.

52
00:02:59.372 --> 00:03:01.753
"You're probably right, Terrell."

53
00:03:03.094 --> 00:03:04.795
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

54
00:03:05.775 --> 00:03:06.796
She looked at her friends.

55
00:03:08.268 --> 00:03:13.229
"I'm going to, um, get some snacks," she said.

56
00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:16.010
She stood up and started to walk away.

57
00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:18.791
"Oh!" cried Mara.

58
00:03:18.811 --> 00:03:21.492
"Can you get some popcorn for me?"

59
00:03:21.512 --> 00:03:24.032
"And another soda for me!"

60
00:03:24.352 --> 00:03:24.913
said Jack.

61
00:03:24.933 --> 00:03:27.213
"I'll have a pretzel!"

62
00:03:27.553 --> 00:03:28.233
said Terrell.

63
00:03:29.194 --> 00:03:30.334
Roxy rolled her eyes.

64
00:03:30.354 --> 00:03:33.095
"Oh, uh, sure."

65
00:03:35.175 --> 00:03:37.596
Roxy ran up the stairs and found a quiet area.

66
00:03:43.052 --> 00:03:44.414
She pressed a button on her watch.

67
00:03:44.434 --> 00:03:47.818
"Mayor Bloom," said Roxy.

68
00:03:47.838 --> 00:03:49.460
"What's going on?"

69
00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.864
"We have a problem, Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

70
00:03:52.884 --> 00:03:56.448
"Someone robbed an armored truck on West Street!"

71
00:03:56.468 --> 00:03:58.951
"Don't worry," said Roxy.

72
00:03:58.971 --> 00:04:01.715
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
